    "_postman_id": "cb121af9-24a8-4abe-8d22-19f3757ad466",
    "name": "Abcuro Content API (WordPress REST) Investors API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The public, anonymously readable WordPress REST API serving abcuro.com — the corporate site of Abcuro, a clinical-stage biotechnology company developing ulviprubart (ABC008), a KLRG1-targeting monoclonal antibody for inclusion body myositis, T-LGLL and mature T and NK cell lymphomas.\n\nThis document was DERIVED by API Evangelist from the live route discovery document at https://abcuro.com/wp-json/ (fetched 2026-08-02) plus observed response shapes. It is not published by Abcuro and is not an official contract. Only the GET surface that answers anonymously is modelled. The live route index also registers POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE on most collections plus the redirection/v1, yoast/v1, genesis/v1, pum/v1, wp-site-health/v1 and wp-block-editor/v1 plugin namespaces; all of those require WordPress cookie+nonce or application-password authentication and are deliberately not modelled here.\n\nAbcuro publishes no developer portal, no SDKs, no changelog and no product API. This is a corporate website content API, catalogued because it is the only machine-readable surface the company exposes.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Abcuro General Inquiries\n Email: corporate.contact@abcuro.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
